1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:01,540
You're an agent.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:04,115
You already find people places to stay.

3
00:00:04,305 --> 00:00:06,180
On HAMLET, the stays you close

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,950
can earn you a commission.

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,920
Here's how it works, in four simple steps.

6
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:12,185
Step one.

7
00:00:12,205 --> 00:00:13,805
Join the HAMLET partner network

8
00:00:13,805 --> 00:00:15,503
as a closing agent.

9
00:00:15,613 --> 00:00:16,768
Step two.

10
00:00:16,788 --> 00:00:18,088
Open Share and Studio,

11
00:00:18,088 --> 00:00:20,163
and pick from verified stays that

12
00:00:20,163 --> 00:00:22,687
owners have opened to the partner network.

13
00:00:22,797 --> 00:00:24,347
Make a branded property card with

14
00:00:24,347 --> 00:00:26,497
your name on it, or a QR code,

15
00:00:26,497 --> 00:00:29,195
and share it on WhatsApp in a tap.

16
00:00:29,305 --> 00:00:31,355
Every link carries your own tracking code.

17
00:00:31,355 --> 00:00:33,285
So when your client books through

18
00:00:33,305 --> 00:00:35,588
it, the booking is linked to you.

19
00:00:35,698 --> 00:00:36,828
Step three.

20
00:00:36,848 --> 00:00:38,403
Your client sends a request,

21
00:00:38,403 --> 00:00:40,158
the host accepts, and your client

22
00:00:40,178 --> 00:00:42,257
pays safely through HAMLET.

23
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:43,397
Step four.

24
00:00:43,417 --> 00:00:44,872
When the stay is completed,

25
00:00:44,892 --> 00:00:46,222
your commission is recorded

26
00:00:46,242 --> 00:00:47,472
in your ledger.

27
00:00:47,492 --> 00:00:49,222
It's paid from HAMLET's fee,

28
00:00:49,242 --> 00:00:51,392
so the owner's rate stays whole.

29
00:00:51,502 --> 00:00:53,557
And when you invite other partners,

30
00:00:53,577 --> 00:00:55,352
you can earn referral rewards on

31
00:00:55,352 --> 00:00:57,335
their completed bookings too.

32
00:00:57,445 --> 00:00:58,670
Share verified stays.

33
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:00,250
Get credited.

34
00:01:00,270 --> 00:01:02,693
Join HAMLET as a closing agent.
